{"w":2400,"h":3164,"lines":[{"y":0.049418604525550469,"h":0.014534883945238386,"x":0.099616856525166594,"t":"Audioscripts","w":0.11685824076334635,"c":1},{"t":"STEPHANIE:","x":0.10149084027810965,"c":1,"h":0.011956583835683765,"w":0.078627516428629557,"y":0.097219382358724737},{"c":1,"t":"STEPHANIE:","y":0.28924418624525261,"w":0.078544057210286469,"x":0.10153257021350294,"h":0.011627906191665427},{"w":0.059569015502929701,"t":"TREVOR.","y":0.30776778453690556,"c":1,"x":0.10144154579548534,"h":0.0094644308994451531},{"y":0.38655531399096033,"h":0.011773092556843778,"w":0.076666431427001969,"c":1,"x":0.10342923741484886,"t":"STEPHANIE:"},{"c":1,"h":0.0087209302465773852,"y":0.40406976741870104,"x":0.1034482766325826,"w":0.057471262613932289,"t":"TREVOR:"},{"t":"TREVOR:","h":0.0088991925930405058,"w":0.059432048797607412,"x":0.101510029148527,"y":0.44322482229331805,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.10135958837575738,"y":0.4744559909447631,"t":"STEPHANIE:","w":0.078890018463134773,"h":0.011843832042515712},{"x":0.10138078178603341,"y":0.5071295776053264,"t":"TREVOR:","w":0.059885056813557935,"c":1,"h":0.010199699932344375},{"c":1,"x":0.10147815280816933,"h":0.01205833762997166,"y":0.53902897063481747,"w":0.078652890523274732,"t":"STEPHANIE:"},{"c":1,"x":0.10344827702636718,"y":0.57122093018982911,"t":"TREVOR:","h":0.010174418520535577,"w":0.057471262613932303},{"h":0.012626479157304304,"c":1,"y":0.58525652765601976,"t":"STEPHANIE:","x":0.10332507059362013,"w":0.078790473937988284},{"h":0.012660166406450624,"w":0.061628913879394551,"t":"TREVOR:","c":1,"x":0.10136945186668879,"y":0.6491931724040384},{"c":1,"h":0.013856744344255545,"t":"STEPHANIE:","w":0.080672760009765629,"x":0.10142607238835945,"y":0.66676348820846354},{"y":0.79474801692431019,"h":0.0093411754265747549,"t":"TREVOR:","x":0.10145609250777361,"w":0.059539922078450533,"c":1},{"w":0.078588733673095712,"c":1,"x":0.10151023198284326,"y":0.80949289998731977,"h":0.010374664808193712,"t":"STEPHANIE:"},{"t":"TREVOR:","y":0.84292755770976313,"w":0.059435329437255852,"h":0.0089123264124661983,"x":0.10150838882854565,"c":1},{"t":"STEPHANIE.","x":0.10344827481626313,"h":0.010174418520535577,"y":0.85901162793631636,"c":1,"w":0.076628354390462242},{"w":0.05969139099121093,"t":"TREVOR:","x":0.10138035804079543,"h":0.011250511584179446,"y":0.87446195349326894,"c":1},{"x":0.099447971555877215,"c":1,"t":"STEPHANIE:","y":0.9078041531955946,"h":0.014333553772358565,"w":0.080797545115152983},{"w":0.61694976806640622,"t":"That's good. I remember some frightening ones I saw as a child and I can still see","x":0.19536164485346566,"y":0.09434700730504908,"h":0.015521072406985748,"c":1},{"x":0.19338016890372528,"y":0.11014220472810954,"c":1,"t":"them vividly in my mind, years later! Pictures can be so powerful, just as powerful","w":0.61517506917317699,"h":0.018794134504122928},{"w":0.61302683512369782,"x":0.19348658240041744,"c":1,"t":"as words. I've always enjoyed drawing, so that's the field I want to go into when","y":0.12790697662836159,"h":0.01463411068343623},{"w":0.42145594278971349,"x":0.19348658801527335,"h":0.014624922977838239,"t":"finish the course. I bet that module will be really helpful.","c":1,"y":0.14380530968446925},{"c":1,"w":0.61127934773763015,"t":"I'm sure it will. We also studied comics in that module, but I'm not convinced of","h":0.017699083697177986,"x":0.19341301978602862,"y":0.15838485151367832},{"c":1,"t":"their value, not compared with books. One of the great things about words is that","y":0.17349835550250203,"w":0.62482065836588552,"x":0.19527426233563355,"h":0.019346591645637456},{"t":"you use your imagination, but with a comic you don't have to.","x":0.19348659554595202,"h":0.014650648674078726,"c":1,"y":0.19331395337146806,"w":0.47509577433268224},{"h":0.015879892669947826,"c":1,"x":0.19727252403305651,"t":"But children are so used to visual input - on TV, video games, and so on. There","y":0.20773062222314187,"w":0.61312266031901042},{"c":1,"y":0.22529069755923636,"h":0.014595522440489561,"t":"are plenty of kids who wouldn't even try to read a book, so I think comics can","x":0.19540229262497633,"w":0.597701161702474},{"w":0.22816660563151039,"h":0.014148349255587056,"t":"serve a really useful purpose","x":0.19337416337930866,"y":0.24174254694904918,"c":1},{"h":0.016750902954757452,"y":0.25529452502263228,"c":1,"x":0.19535047445071729,"t":"You mean, it's better to read a comic than not to read at all? Yes, I suppose you're","w":0.62845474243164068},{"w":0.43486587524414066,"t":"right. I just think it's sad when children don't read books.","y":0.27325581383785702,"h":0.014670861505829191,"x":0.1954023113252065,"c":1},{"w":0.5901359558105469,"x":0.19153256587391146,"t":"What about books for girls and books for boys? Does the course go into that?","y":0.28776164436733054,"h":0.01647762583118928,"c":1},{"y":0.30372945610450275,"x":0.19731800698326385,"h":0.014584497314337419,"w":0.55747126261393232,"t":"Yes, there's a module on it. For years, lots of stories, in English, at least,","c":1},{"y":0.31967020767612109,"w":0.58250122070312493,"t":"assumed that boys went out and did adventurous things and girls stayed at","h":0.01752186062664518,"x":0.19534289846653194,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"home and played with dolls. I was amazed how many books were targeted at just Q25","y":0.33567750854282918,"w":0.67442428588867198,"x":0.19535637095069508,"h":0.016889126653466313},{"x":0.19540230461026406,"t":"one sex or the other. Of course this reflects society as it is when the books are","y":0.35319767430354365,"w":0.6053639729817708,"h":0.014691074337579435,"c":1},{"t":"written.","w":0.061539300282796194,"x":0.19336828081156815,"y":0.37031316618013399,"h":0.013734132691972878,"c":1},{"h":0.014635948103990382,"t":"That's true. So it sounds as though you think it's a good course.","c":1,"x":0.19540229610978901,"y":0.38517441848923806,"w":0.49425287882486979},{"t":"Definitely.","c":1,"h":0.015433240328666997,"y":0.40027885683511188,"x":0.19506653128909146,"w":0.077401943206787116},{"t":"Have you been reading lots of children's stories, to help you decide whether to","h":0.014676373767491091,"y":0.44026548680447464,"c":1,"w":0.60344828287760421,"x":0.1973180041515718},{"y":0.45784883724288139,"x":0.19540230205768921,"w":0.13218390146891273,"c":1,"h":0.010229544754124853,"t":"take the course?"},{"y":0.47238372081442648,"x":0.19540230315442006,"t":"Yeah. I've gone as far back as the late seventeenth century, though I know there","w":0.62068964640299473,"h":0.014657998356294666,"c":1},{"w":0.23006866455078123,"h":0.013152487811487701,"x":0.19719137359953276,"y":0.48857425980216407,"c":1,"t":"were earlier children's stories."},{"h":0.01611883691529703,"c":1,"t":"So does that mean you've read Perrault's fairy tales? Cinderella, The Sleeping","x":0.1954022885213044,"y":0.5056890012896571,"w":0.60727971394856772},{"w":0.14750957489013675,"c":1,"y":0.52180232580306829,"h":0.016124349176959041,"t":"Beauty, and so on.","x":0.19731800933614171},{"w":0.6053639729817708,"h":0.014674536346937161,"c":1,"t":"Yes. They must be important, because no stories of that type had been written","y":0.53779069755987385,"x":0.19540230459791777},{"h":0.015988371616368346,"c":1,"y":0.55232558143382171,"x":0.19540231798474547,"w":0.54022984822591147,"t":"before, these were the first. Then there's The Swiss Family Robinson."},{"t":"I haven't read that.","x":0.19540230218615767,"y":0.56976744156662495,"w":0.14750957489013672,"h":0.014619410716176229,"c":1},{"x":0.19731801602830795,"y":0.58565107448858822,"t":"The English name makes it sound as though Robinson is the family's surname,","w":0.61111109415690112,"h":0.013274336283185861,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395068451962,"x":0.19731801487330775,"t":"but a more accurate translation would be The Swiss Robinsons, because it's","y":0.60174418618453118,"w":0.59003829956054688,"c":1},{"w":0.67432947794596354,"h":0.014534883945238386,"t":"about a Swiss family who are shipwrecked, like Robinson Crusoe in the novel of Q27","y":0.61773255802509541,"c":1,"x":0.19540231074990308},{"x":0.19540230288623331,"y":0.63369152943770668,"w":0.13218390146891276,"h":0.014564284482587064,"c":1,"t":"a century earlier."},{"c":1,"t":"Well I never knew that!","w":0.18007662455240886,"h":0.013081395068451962,"x":0.1954023006538001,"y":0.64970930245874092},{"t":"Have you read Hoffmann's The Nutcracker and the Mouse King?","x":0.1954023081092032,"h":0.014619410113347886,"c":1,"y":0.66561314813555661,"w":0.50191569010416659},{"w":0.48098358154296877,"y":0.68083355835204962,"t":"Wasn't that the basis for Tchaikovsky's ballet The Nutcracker?","h":0.015898782896483166,"c":1,"x":0.19532786373590832},{"w":0.036398468017578178,"t":"Q28","y":0.68168604661334586,"h":0.013081395068451962,"x":0.83333333294523393,"c":1},{"h":0.015883267302579496,"c":1,"t":"That's right. It has some quite bizarre elements.","x":0.19531899772426395,"w":0.36991053263346352,"y":0.69762606020805584},{"w":0.60727971394856772,"y":0.7136536032253441,"h":0.01611883691529703,"c":1,"t":"I hope you've read Oscar Wilde's The Happy Prince. It's probably my favourite","x":0.19348657976913244},{"x":0.19540230144362611,"t":"children's story of all time.","y":0.73103666251533883,"h":0.013274336283185861,"w":0.20498083750406901,"c":1},{"t":"Mine too! And it's so surprising, because Wilde is best known for his plays, and","c":1,"x":0.19348659839521037,"y":0.74557522117967601,"w":0.61111109415690112,"h":0.016118836915297141},{"c":1,"t":"most of them are very witty, but The Happy Prince is really moving. Istruggled","x":0.19540230457417312,"y":0.7616279072111336,"h":0.015988371616368346,"w":0.6053639729817708},{"h":0.013081395068451962,"x":0.83333333294523393,"w":0.036398468017578178,"c":1,"y":0.76162790707846206,"t":"Q29"},{"x":0.19540230313527768,"h":0.014654323515186807,"c":1,"y":0.77749683938520153,"t":"with. Tolkien's The Lord of the Rings - three long books, and I gave up after one.","w":0.62068964640299473},{"x":0.1954023048909474,"y":0.79360465104447775,"t":"It's extremely popular, though.","w":0.23563217163085937,"c":1,"h":0.014549583912498609},{"h":0.016133536882557253,"y":0.80813953511958114,"w":0.62835250854492186,"c":1,"t":"Yeah, but whereas something like The Happy Prince just carried me along with it,","x":0.19540228969246509},{"x":0.19719391258146421,"w":0.52899119059244792,"t":"The Lord of the Rings took more effort than I was prepared to give it.","h":0.018429033373460135,"c":1,"y":0.82254145171135917},{"x":0.19523542444838393,"t":"I didn't find that - I love it.","w":0.20151069641113284,"h":0.015205469505223279,"c":1,"y":0.83955748661145768},{"x":0.19715412196066268,"h":0.015759123260845276,"c":1,"t":"Another one l've read is War Horse.","y":0.85496345092375092,"w":0.27818021138509114},{"t":"Oh yes. It's about the First World War, isn't it? Hardly what you'd expect for a","x":0.19533608494964805,"y":0.87205771317763325,"w":0.59783350626627607,"c":1,"h":0.01752257316965522},{"h":0.013081395068451962,"x":0.83333333294523393,"t":"Q30","w":0.036398468017578178,"y":0.87354651172962494,"c":1},{"t":"children's story.","x":0.1951190763469649,"y":0.88859362757463534,"w":0.12123836517333986,"h":0.015690401441378787,"c":1},{"y":0.90834386859991556,"h":0.016118836915297141,"c":1,"t":"Exactly, but it's been very successful. Have you read any ...","x":0.19540230572182551,"w":0.45977010091145831},{"x":0.10153256666170904,"c":1,"t":"116","w":0.036398468017578123,"h":0.013081395068451962,"y":0.95494186056683428}]}